  "description": "SOBTIO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: (C42 H23 Cl27 O53 Pr8 Sb24 2-)n,4(C36 H24 Fe1 N6),2(C6 H8 N1 1+),42(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr5 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr6 (Pr) has 6 O neighbors; Pr7 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr8 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr1_2 (Pr) has 1 O neighbors; Pr7_2 (Pr) has 1 O neighbors; Pr8_2 (Pr) has 1 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe3 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe4 (Fe) has 0 O neighbors; Fe4B? (Fe) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 10 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.745-4.878 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 117.74-124.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C198H219N26O95Cl27Fe4Sb24Pr8.",
